      "description": "Watch Austin FC vs FC Dallas highlights and goals from Major League Soccer on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 17, 2026. A hard-fought battle in the MLS On August 17, 2026, Austin FC and FC Dallas faced off in a high-stakes encounter that tested the resolve of both sides. This Major League Soccer clash provided a masterclass in tactical discipline and momentum shifts throughout the 90 minutes. Building tension before the break The match began with physical intensity, leading to early bookings for Ramiro and Mateja Djordjevic . As the first half drew to a close, FC Dallas managed to break the deadlock in stoppage time. Lalas Abubakar found the back of the net following a crisp assist from Santiago no , shifting the emotional momentum in favor of the visitors as they headed into the interval. The second-half turning point The game opened up after the restart, with Austin FC pushing hard for an equalizer. They found their moment at the 57-minute mark when Ervin Torres leveled the score. However, the parity was short-lived as FC Dallas regained their composure. In the 73rd minute, Petar Musa scored the decisive goal, clinically converting an assist from Joaquin Valiente . The final minutes were fraught with defensive tension and several cautions, including a late yellow for Myrto Uzuni , but the score remained firm as the referee signaled the end of the match."
